{"time": 1774169373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194437615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“里希特警官？怎么会？”震惊之余镇静了下来，“怎么死的……”"}
{"time": 1774169376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312791511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（草）"}
{"time": 1774169386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675986847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“退休警官里希特先生于昨晚死在家中，唯一的失踪物品是他的装饰性地球仪——也就是你们包里的这个——我没说错吧？”"}
{"time": 1774169403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1342537251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "审讯你们的依然是安德鲁斯先生"}
{"time": 1774169425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944351934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“我昨天已经来警局跟你们说明了去拜访的情况”"}
{"time": 1774169439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846769810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“那个地球仪是里希特先生给我们的”"}
{"time": 1774169442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649620222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“地球仪我们是经过了里希特先生允许的情况下拿走的”"}
{"time": 1774169443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343585292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“并且昨天晚上你们来时也提到去过里希特先生家里，我们也确实在里希特家里的台历找到了你们前来的记录”"}
{"time": 1774169470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328526312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“虽然但是，你也看到了，我们昨天晚上跟本不在这个州”"}
{"time": 1774169505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793442193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“我们昨天拜访完里杀人特警官就立刻来了警局后面又直接开车去另一个州部门，有不在场证明”"}
{"time": 1774169529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177366759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“况且我们也给你看了里希特先生为我们担保做的签名”"}
{"time": 1774169533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769844164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1194437615]“昨天晚上，约十二点左右，被人杀死在家中”"}
{"time": 1774169572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718008859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“十二点，我们已经不在这里了。”"}
{"time": 1774169591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439826427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=177366759]“所以我需要的是你们会面的详细情况，你们聊了什么，又为什么要拿走这个地球仪？你们还知道什么？”"}
{"time": 1774169630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072012170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“我们昨天提醒你加强对那件案子有关的警官保护你们却没当回事这不是你们警察的失职吗”"}
{"time": 1774169652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990140691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（回旋镖了）"}
{"time": 1774169702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676705487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“昨天我们才答应了里希特警官，等我们查到了事件的真相会回来告诉他，他说他会等我们，我们便来提醒你们要多注意相关人员的安全问题，如果你们及时去调查书店和礼拜堂就有可能抓到他们，警官也不会去世”"}
{"time": 1774169772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712620185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“里希特警官，真是个好人啊，可惜了。”"}
{"time": 1774169847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786054357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（诶嘿嘿嘿"}
{"time": 1774169880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636606829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "安德鲁斯摇头“事实上，我们的警员已经重点在附近的街区巡逻了——但是他们什么也没看到，直到第二天凌晨才注意到里希特已经死在了自己的床上，死因是刀伤，疑似是于睡梦中被人杀害的，然而我们并没有找到行凶的刀具。”"}
{"time": 1774169916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1574554493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=676705487]“至于书店和礼拜堂，昨天晚上并没有任何人出入。”"}
{"time": 1774169930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2002556578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“里希特先生将之前他在沉思礼拜堂行动的事情告诉了我们，包括当时他见到的那些人做某种仪式的细节，我们和他说在布朗家见到了和他这个地球仪的仿品，这个地球仪是当年他在礼拜堂带走的，也许是那些人有用的东西，我们便问警官拿了”"}
{"time": 1774169978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738832693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "与此同时，审讯室外部赶来另一批警员，并对安德鲁斯说了些什么"}
{"time": 1774169989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334358605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“我想有可能是像托马斯越狱一样，他们用了相似的手法，无声无息的进出”"}
{"time": 1774170001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173551007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1738832693][CQ:at,qq=3362422751] 听"}
