{"time": 1774770025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515716286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "在你们犹豫了几分钟后，安德鲁斯又走了出来“卧室内部、办公室内部都有现场被破坏的痕迹。”"}
{"time": 1774770052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216643230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=41BF1AE26D57979B41AB27B714868971.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRqZZkOqveVBeDjOrQv7AnOvSb63xjJnQQg_woo-8vs083EkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQc76KqsDm5zRhogXMktbweXoCiKiCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMGD_T12yKC6qDktIhDcBdumF9m5XGBhrA_oFORy6STIhwv1LFwS16CHDYEpw3mw1sQ,file_size=69321]"}
{"time": 1774770097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708490189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=68A1DB352866DD9BE539425F1FB94415.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR_jEkV-pvWRP9_TR_m_P6lb6Ut2hjrggMg_woo5J226c3EkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQYE1Pc0KqMh3CCr58Dv41wXoCRhqCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMGD_T12yKC6qDktIhDcBdumF9m5XGBhrA_oFORy6STIhwv1LFwS16CHDYEpw3mw1sQ,file_size=49515]"}
{"time": 1774770163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902802666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“侦探游戏玩够了吗？你们就这么不把警方的时间当时间，把警方的工作当作你们游戏而被随意浪费、破坏的背景？”"}
{"time": 1774770175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606876440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（万一是他自己弄的呢）"}
{"time": 1774770189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560761993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（又要坐牢了说是）"}
{"time": 1774770197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1426902894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=D28689EE52B47DF09793807EEB13C5BB.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT-zrqaBpNWAa5p3Ax4S3ZP3HMjBRjy8wIg_woom8r2mM7EkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ9Vg1KaAxIH9jKJM1q9XcTnoCcm-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMGD_T12yKC6qDktIhDcBdumF9m5XGBhrA_oFORy6STIhwv1LFwS16CHDYEpw3mw1sQ,file_size=47602]"}
{"time": 1774770273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49088936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“当作游戏？到底是谁不重视这件事情？我们提供的所有线索，你们都不当回事，明明有非常明确的不在场证明，还要把我们扣了一晚上却不去找真正的凶手的线索”"}
{"time": 1774770304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "893524910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“你们警方这样子办事，还不让我们为了自己的朋友去查明真相”"}
{"time": 1774770426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464480571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“就是，我们来现场不是搞破坏，是怕你们漏了线索！再说了，现场被碰过的痕迹，谁能保证不是你们自己进进出出弄的？”"}
{"time": 1774770459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719603933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“当年里希特警官他们突袭教堂的事件没有任何的报告报道，你敢说你们政府内部没有人在刻意压制这件事情吗？”"}
{"time": 1774770498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839676027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（好猛）"}
{"time": 1774770510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767153603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（好猛）"}
{"time": 1774770547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587833364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“你们政府不作为，甚至还有人刻意压制事件的真相，还有托马斯越狱的事，你们至今都没有查清，若非你们效率低下，怎还会有孩子持续的失踪，里希特警官又怎么会惨死在家中”"}
{"time": 1774770562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533977808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（好猛）"}
{"time": 1774770577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969037046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=49088936]安德鲁斯深深地看着你“小姑娘，和你们一句一句反驳不是我们的工作，但我建议你们好好学习社会法治工作的程序正义的必要性”"}
{"time": 1774770641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275544142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“程序正义？隐瞒了这么多案件的细节，就是你们的程序正义，若非你们不作为行动慢，我们又何须冒险为我们的亲朋讨回公道”"}
{"time": 1774770664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865831387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1587833364]“这个社会始终是复杂且矛盾的，没有被裹挟在内的旁观者永远可以大言不惭地做出评价”"}
{"time": 1774770735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046565021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“是，你们有你们的难言之隐，有复杂的程序，那也不应该阻止勇敢的人去查明真相”"}
{"time": 1774770799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873816728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“对你们来说死的人是死者是纸上冰冷的名字，可是对我们来说他可是前几日还活生生站在我们面前，与我们交流的朋友，是当年努力救出了教堂里孩子伟大的警官”"}
{"time": 1774770866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "98449978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“而你们，你们还年轻，还有大把的机会可以挥霍……不过，我有些受够了。你们当然可以继续你们的侦探过家家——但前提是不要影响市民以及警方工作生活的正常秩序。如果我下一次收到你们扰乱治安的报告，你们就可以在牢狱内度过很长一段时间了。”"}
{"time": 1774770904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037765232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=873816728]“？”"}
{"time": 1774770921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761164271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“你们与其盯着我们去死守什么程序的正确，还不如多花点时间去跟着那些还在活动的信徒们”"}
{"time": 1774771046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061872289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=98449978]“放心好了，我们应该不会再见面了，我们要离开这里，去更远的地方寻找托马斯这个恶人的踪迹了”"}
{"time": 1774771050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51647870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（走吧）"}
{"time": 1774771065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446016178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "*出发前往精神病院"}
{"time": 1774771067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090904517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（好帅）"}
{"time": 1774771067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245683281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1774771070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100068356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "你能感到安德鲁斯有些愤怒了，他收起袖子，展露出许多道纵横的刀伤与几道深浅不一的枪伤伤口"}
{"time": 1774771079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098583249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（我的天哪xsl大人）"}
{"time": 1774771146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989170971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "他拦住了你，“我不能对你刚刚那句话置之不理，请你收回这句话”"}
{"time": 1774771156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352262436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "他用冰冷愤怒的眼神凝视着你"}
{"time": 1774771170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233849236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（太强了"}
{"time": 1774771254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654156695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“冒犯了警官大人，只是我们答应了里希特警官，一定会带着事件的真相回来找他，见他惨死我们十分的难过，其实我们都是朝着同一个方向努力的人没必要站在对立面”"}
{"time": 1774771292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198266254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“请您相信我们，过不了多久，我们一定会将那些人带到法庭上”"}
{"time": 1774771390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117923727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "安德鲁斯吐出一口气“我更希望你们这些小孩能安安全全地活下来——但是我不会阻拦你们，只是，至少做好，为自己坚信之事付出代价的准备。”"}
{"time": 1774771416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34996525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“走吧，我不想再见到你们了…”"}
