{"time": 1775895268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026059336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（的时间）"}
{"time": 1775895278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366373294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“啊？我听你说她正在接待访客，我还以为。。。。。”"}
{"time": 1775895328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729951256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“不不不，只是她的一个小表妹过来探望她，大多时候我看她都只是默默坐着，或许是在怀念些什么吧…唉…”"}
{"time": 1775895418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200265443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "*靠近同伴们低声说：“我怀疑那位小表妹就是玛丽的意识，来看望她原本的身体，也是这位小表妹来保释我们的”"}
{"time": 1775895453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112632432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“所以她才说她叫玛丽，然而我们 一查，却发现玛丽是医院里的植物人”"}
{"time": 1775895466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168881197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（哇哦）"}
{"time": 1775895470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380924557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "点点头"}
{"time": 1775895474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848744146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“那这样一说一切就合理了。”"}
{"time": 1775895481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938423032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“但是我们没有证据啊万一她不说咋整”"}
{"time": 1775895487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411742023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=EEE218B64617E892D7189DA0ACD3382C.png,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ0wPpWKF2xzO-xDGuWIAj2Ke4WHRiy2Dgg_woo0KaRna7lkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQgDz1cr53eo5Ukl3yAFGdgXoCLHKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMAtz-MRqpk4kE1CNkPjVviWSUw8X4mwbJn4m3d7befeSz1IbLLsqBkVHAJndnfklIA,file_size=928818]"}
{"time": 1775895538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674886247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“她既然保释了我们应该是希望见我们的，不然她何必让 警方这么轻易把我们放出来”"}
{"time": 1775895560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244885847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“我觉得她可能和二手书店里的那些人是不一样的”"}
{"time": 1775895586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28953984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=DE23B5D16FC95092F5084E67033D5AD9.png,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS2LPMcA4RmPyFCrTNNvHKjRNEpGRiHlLcBIP8KKKzXt8yu5ZMDMgRwcm9kUIC9owFaEIZe4Xb9_z43p-iEMmArSpp6AormggECZ3o&amp;rkey=CAMSMAtz-MRqpk4kE1CNkPjVviWSUw8X4mwbJn4m3d7befeSz1IbLLsqBkVHAJndnfklIA,file_size=3000839]"}
{"time": 1775895624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511800753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“中，我们在这蹲她”"}
{"time": 1775895694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901798384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（意思就直接在这等是吧）"}
{"time": 1775895703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094892563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（yes"}
{"time": 1775895712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539468129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（蹲点）"}
{"time": 1775895713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070189144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（其他人还有要聊的吗"}
{"time": 1775895732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336102782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（无）"}
{"time": 1775895798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768670392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“我想问一下玛丽一直以来的医药费是谁支付的”"}
{"time": 1775895819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192260316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“是他们的家庭。”"}
{"time": 1775895868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344304359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（我应该问完了）"}
{"time": 1775895888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125600255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "没过几分钟，房间的门便打开了一些，探出来一个小女孩，她似乎有些惊喜地看到你们“哥哥姐姐你们也来了？一起进来吧！”"}
{"time": 1775896004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977242897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "*进入"}
{"time": 1775896008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889664484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "总之先进去"}
{"time": 1775896016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079061672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*跟随"}
{"time": 1775896053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105790327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "秘书看起来虽然有些疑惑，但还是看着你们进入之后一个人坐在外面"}
{"time": 1775896053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "936385941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "*跟随大家"}
{"time": 1775896181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "346570344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "你们一齐进入了病房，房间内有一张不大的病床，上面正躺着一位中年女性，盖着被子，看起来正双目无神地盯着天花板，嘴角微微张着"}
{"time": 1775896230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548395645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "小女孩默默地坐下，看着有些恍惚地盯着病床上的女人，随后叹了一口气，“你们终于来了。”"}
{"time": 1775896380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550805045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“你是当年礼拜堂案件的教徒之一吧”"}
{"time": 1775896409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036805657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“是你去保释我们的吧”"}
{"time": 1775896433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447588201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "她瞥了你们一眼，点了点头“对，我就是玛丽，保释了你们的也是我。”"}
{"time": 1775896474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418058024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“你们为什么要去里希特警官家？还是杀害了他”"}
{"time": 1775896500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483581139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“他现在只是一个退休的警员，已经威胁不到你们了吧”"}
{"time": 1775896557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35111627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "玛丽有些犹豫“我没有去里希特家，是其他的那些人干的，应该是托马斯和一直跟着他的那几只应声虫。”"}
{"time": 1775896620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994997905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“他们去那里干什么？拿地球仪吗？那是用来做什么的”"}
{"time": 1775896625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726118555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“不过，那个地球仪…在你们身上吧？”她看了过来，如渴求又紧张地盯着你们"}
{"time": 1775896639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358558100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“你先回答我们的问题”"}
{"time": 1775896740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848961376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1994997905]“…是的，那是个仪式道具，他们需要这个道具以转移到新的躯体之上，解决他们多年来被困在孩子身体里的困境…”"}
{"time": 1775896786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968685413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“而我，我已经厌倦了……多年以来被困在这具幼小无力的身体中——我只想回到我自己的身体里！求求你们帮我！”"}
{"time": 1775896799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660584972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“？困境？到孩子身上不是自愿的吗”"}
{"time": 1775896839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890537080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "你们"}
{"time": 1775896924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878900449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“到孩子身上不是挺好的吗？永远不会衰老”"}
{"time": 1775896946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817497030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“你们利用孩子的身份图了不少方便呢”"}
{"time": 1775896952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72007773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1660584972]玛丽摇摇头“并不，几十年前那场仪式因为警方的打断并未顺利完成。事实上，一个受人类疾病和弱点影响的身体并不是托马斯他们真正的目标…”"}
{"time": 1775897026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549117169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1817497030]“但与之而来的也是更多无法接受的代价…”"}
{"time": 1775897051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831662382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“所以那只是实验，你们真正想的要一个不会死亡没有疾病的…..容器？”"}
{"time": 1775897106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82238228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“也许？我们并不清楚托马斯到底该如何实现他的目标，不过，他最终的目标，应该是——成为神明？”玛丽的语气带着些不确定"}
{"time": 1775897118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760454917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（妈妈咪呀"}
{"time": 1775897119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540242171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（卡密）"}
{"time": 1775897124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674399484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（卡密！）"}
{"time": 1775897126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759778072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“你们绑架了那么多孩子进行如此可怕的仪式，现在你们所承受的一切都是你们罪有应得，说，我们做噩梦，是不是也是你们做的”"}
{"time": 1775897182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094145774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1968685413][CQ:at,qq=3362422751] “但是，据我所知，应该有很多人不愿意回到原来的身体吧”"}
{"time": 1775897266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "880095645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "玛丽有些愤愤然又无奈“让你们做噩梦的确实也是托马斯他们，就连我也被他们要挟得参与其中，但是我没办法违抗他们——我不想死，我只想回到我原来的身体里赎罪！”"}
{"time": 1775897303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1841615316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（怎么鉴定？他是不是在说谎）"}
{"time": 1775897306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2335125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1094145774]“是的，所以他们要地球仪的目标是在此更换身体…”"}
{"time": 1775897313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673178097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（心理学）"}
{"time": 1775897326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402187711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“而我只想换回原来的身体”"}
{"time": 1775897353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "134539839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（或者说以你超强的洞察能力不断质问让kp圆不下去）"}
{"time": 1775897358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56917909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“你们也想救那个孩子吧？只有这样才能让我们各自回归原来的身体，孩子们才有恢复的可能性！”"}
