{"time": 1775977093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065358972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“当然是因为相信了托马斯可以带领我们这些信徒一起永生…”"}
