{"time": 1775979230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818270777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“更年轻的身体？但我这边得到的说法是被托马斯置换过的身体不会衰老”"}
{"time": 1775979237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155102446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": ".st潜行"}
{"time": 1775979237, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1155102446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[哈里]的[潜行]: 40"}
{"time": 1775979377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759234720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=818270777]玛丽看着你像是在看某种蠢物“我们更换的不就是更年轻的身体？这有什么冲突的吗？不会衰老也只是因为警方的突然打断罢了，如果不是突然中断导致仪式出了问题，这些身体本可以正常发育的。”"}
{"time": 1775979530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208381546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=940031767]点点头“你之前说托马斯不值得信任，那你现在与托马斯及其信徒仍在保持联系吗？他有对你最近保释我们的行动产生怀疑吗？”"}
{"time": 1775979628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226482066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“他们仍然有办法联系我，但他们根本不知道是我保释的你们，除了在托马斯发任务要求我们我们完成之外，我们个人生活一直都是自由的。”"}
{"time": 1775979731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118264376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=210188214][CQ:at,qq=3362422751] “你说托马斯一定程度上在监视我们，那么他的监视到了什么程度？”"}
{"time": 1775980004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374979201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“他们的仪式可以使他们能看见你们一定时间内的活动地点，但无法得知你们的具体行为”"}
{"time": 1775980034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447800143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“那我们帮你换身体他会知道吗”"}
{"time": 1775980072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832584228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“并不会”"}
{"time": 1775980257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345693352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“那我们登陆时，他不就知道我们登陆了”"}
{"time": 1775980315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923556363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“他是怎么从狱中逃脱的？用了什么手法或者说是法术”"}
{"time": 1775980382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948940806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“政府中有你们的人脉？”"}
